107	            if (-not $inScope.Contains($id)) { continue }
108	            if (-not $rowsByStep.ContainsKey($id)) { $rowsByStep[$id] = [System.Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new() }
109	            $rowsByStep[$id].Add($row)
110	        }
111	    }
112	    $testsByStep = @{}
113	    foreach ($t in @($Inventory | Where-Object { $_ -and $_.Id })) {
114	        foreach ($id in (& $stepsOf $t)) {
115	            if (-not $inScope.Contains($id)) { continue }
116	            if (-not $testsByStep.ContainsKey($id)) { $testsByStep[$id] = [System.Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new() }
117	            $testsByStep[$id].Add($t)
118	        }
119	    }
120	
121	    # OnlyWhen: True, False or Unknown.
122	    $conditionOf = {
123	        param([string] $condition)
124	        if ($condition -eq 'hybrid-identity') {
125	            $hybrid = if ($TenantContext) { & $field $TenantContext 'HybridIdentity' } else { $null }
126	            if ($null -eq $hybrid) { return 'Unknown' }
127	            return $(if ($hybrid) { 'True' } else { 'False' })
128	        }
129	        if ($condition -like 'license:*') {
130	            $licenses = if ($TenantContext) { & $field $TenantContext 'Licenses' } else { $null }
131	            if (-not $licenses -or [string]$licenses.State -ne 'Known') { return 'Unknown' }
132	            return $(if (Test-MtLicenseRequirement -Requirement @($condition.Substring(8)) -Licenses $licenses) { 'True' } else { 'False' })
133	        }
134	        'Unknown'
135	    }
136	
137	    # The measure of a step, in the shape of the result.
138	    $measureOf = {
139	        param($step)
140	        $m = $step.Measure
141	        $key = $m.Key
142	        $entry = $null
143	        $caveat = if ($Registry.Measures.TryGetValue($key, [ref] $entry) -and $entry.Caveat) { $entry.Caveat } else { $null }
144	        $minimum = [int]$m.MinimumShare
145	        if ($MinimumShare.ContainsKey($key) -and $null -ne $MinimumShare[$key]) { $minimum = [int]$MinimumShare[$key] }
146	        $out = [ordered]@{
147	            Key = $key; Count = $null; Total = $null; Share = $null; MinimumShare = $minimum; Met = $null; ReadAt = $null
148	            Caveat = $caveat; ObjectCount = $null; Objects = @(); ReasonCode = $null
149	        }
150	        $reading = if ($Measure.ContainsKey($key)) { $Measure[$key] } else { $null }
151	        if ($MeasuresDisabled) { $out.ReasonCode = 'MeasureOff' }
152	        elseif ($null -eq $reading) { $out.ReasonCode = 'NotRead' }
153	        else {
154	            $out.ReadAt = & $field $reading 'ReadAt'
155	            $code = & $field $reading 'ReasonCode'
156	            if ($code) { $out.ReasonCode = [string]$code }
157	            else {
158	                $count = [int](& $field $reading 'Count')
159	                $total = [int](& $field $reading 'Total')
160	                $objects = @(& $field $reading 'Objects' | ForEach-Object { $_ } | Where-Object { $null -ne $_ })
161	                $objectCount = & $field $reading 'ObjectCount'
162	                $out.Count = $count
163	                $out.Total = $total
164	                $out.Share = if ($total -gt 0) { [int][math]::Floor($count * 100.0 / $total) } else { $null }
165	                # Compared without rounding: 94.9% does not meet 95%. No object to count meets nothing.
166	                $out.Met = $total -gt 0 -and ($count * 100.0) -ge ($minimum * $total)
167	                $out.ObjectCount = if ($null -ne $objectCount) { [int]$objectCount } else { $objects.Count }
168	                $out.Objects = @($objects | Select-Object -First $MaxObjects | ForEach-Object {
169	                        [pscustomobject][ordered]@{ Type = [string](& $field $_ 'Type'); Id = [string](& $field $_ 'Id'); DisplayName = [string](& $field $_ 'DisplayName') }
170	                    })
171	            }
172	        }
173	        [pscustomobject]$out
174	    }
